    "text": "995theapple.com\nwebsite\nPateros\nOne Dead, Another Injured, In SR 153 Head-On Collision\nBy Avery Cooper,\n6 hours agoA Mattawa man is dead while another man has injuries in a head-on collision. Washington State Patrol said it happened at 7:30 this morning on State Route 153 about a mile west of Pateros, when a south-bound sedan, driven by 59-year-old Apolinar Martingarcia, left the roadway towards the shoulder, overcorrected, and drove into the northbound lane.",
